{"title":"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 22","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> is a right triangle with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/2/0728bebb477a2636300c56851b6a6f9e382c1b83.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ACB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"57\" height=\"14\" /> as its right angle, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/d/44d2515ad214ae211c32742bce44b0b655a53380.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m\\angle ABC = 60^\\circ$\" width=\"119\" height=\"13\" /> , and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/b/b6b5b6b078188523fb69a22aff2fbd2b3df42b14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"70\" height=\"13\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> be randomly chosen inside <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> , and extend <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/b/f4bb1db3d066da48df7576e30ef3831ec64cecc7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{BP}$\" width=\"29\" height=\"15\" /> to meet <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/5/12517bbc31cb9026c71299b7a0d232d07e60f284.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" /> at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />. What is the probability that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/a/5bafeabcb6375a0814c5618872e5c4d682b8bca3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BD &gt; 5\\sqrt2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"88\" height=\"18\" />? \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/1/031229b02b99c3f8d5235b9e281cbab7abe4250b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] import math;  unitsize(4mm);  defaultpen(fontsize(8pt)+linewidth(0.7));  dotfactor=4;   pair A=(10,0);  pair C=(0,0);  pair B=(0,10.0/sqrt(3));  pair P=(2,2);  pair D=extension(A,C,B,P);   draw(A--C--B--cycle);  draw(B--D);  dot(P);  label(&quot;A&quot;,A,S);  label(&quot;D&quot;,D,S);  label(&quot;C&quot;,C,S);  label(&quot;P&quot;,P,NE);  label(&quot;B&quot;,B,N);[/asy]\" width=\"205\" height=\"142\" />\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/e/33e1947d2b438ac853db86421dcbf072b2790ca5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{2-\\sqrt2}{2}\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{1}{3}\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{3-\\sqrt3}{3}\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{1}{2}\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\frac{5-\\sqrt5}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"507\" height=\"41\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Clearly <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/1/6e156331c13aae7e86644da6fa391b4389b826d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC=5$\" width=\"61\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/4/8f44cae473c077dc48b426077f305104eeeee650.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC=5\\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"86\" height=\"18\" />. Choose a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/4/3545551b3d62c4e23d5df7352a55602d0aa9adcd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P&#39;$\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> and get a corresponding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/3/b239e47c75fa1adfb0e7d7fb6bf219fcc53f86d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D&#39;$\" width=\"19\" height=\"14\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/1/15179a7947b82f8946e49364fdb3ede404b7daf7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BD&#39;= 5\\sqrt{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"93\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/4/76452d71626e286103ed983ca11680436d77a8aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CD&#39;=5$\" width=\"67\" height=\"14\" />. For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/a/5bafeabcb6375a0814c5618872e5c4d682b8bca3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BD &gt; 5\\sqrt2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"88\" height=\"18\" /> we need <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/1/dd1bbdd39a2d70026c1b8ae80f8b9b4b1d6edd19.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CD&gt;5$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"62\" height=\"13\" />, creating an isosceles right triangle with hypotenuse <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/1/651f5b345fe4324b59ecd5f0e5e079dec2ccd2ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5\\sqrt {2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" /> . Thus the point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> may only lie in the triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/f/63f3deb39b6805de0f0dadfa9ababfe8cc26415f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABD&#39;$\" width=\"47\" height=\"14\" />. The probability of it doing so is the ratio of areas of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/f/63f3deb39b6805de0f0dadfa9ababfe8cc26415f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABD&#39;$\" width=\"47\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" />, or equivalently, the ratio of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/8/ad8019d0fb176ff1ade21d8a9e6d6aa4a1f9563a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD&#39;$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"36\" height=\"16\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a179ff2638e4799cadd820db205c2beff6299ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> because the triangles have identical altitudes when taking <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/8/ad8019d0fb176ff1ade21d8a9e6d6aa4a1f9563a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD&#39;$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"36\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a179ff2638e4799cadd820db205c2beff6299ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> as bases. This ratio is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/6/d460381f29fb0f19215b2afd0662d5c71a319b2f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{AC-CD&#39;}{AC}=1-\\frac{CD&#39;}{AC}=1-\\frac{5}{5\\sqrt{3}}=1-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}= \\frac{3-\\sqrt{3}}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"441\" height=\"45\" />. Thus the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/5/3f58d2efaaa17d28cec9dd927d78708a63b43e24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{C}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/WH38DzdClKM\">https://youtu.be/WH38DzdClKM</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A\">2002 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 23\">Problem 23</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_12_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 12 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 12 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017200403\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.047 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.068 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 252/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2298/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 158/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5916/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   14.078      1 -total\n 53.72%    7.563      1 Template:AMC12_box\n 44.12%    6.211      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:8454:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017200403 and revision id 195862. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}